{c: Verse 1}
[A] [F#m],        Sochta hoon uska dil
[D] [E],        kabhi mujh pe aaye to
[A] [F#m],        Jaan bhi usse de doon main
[A],        woh kisi tarah mujhe
[D] [E] [A],        aajmaye to..aaye toh
[A] [F#m],        Iss dil pe kya kya guzarti hai..
[E] [Bm] [A],        jab uski nazar baat karti hai..
[A] [F#m],        Meri bekhudi barhne lagi
[A],        Woh khayalon main
[D] [E] [A],        jab muskuraye to..aaye to..
Sochta hoon..        [A] [F#m]
Hansta hai koi koi routa hai..        [E] [Bm] [A]
yeh jazba to har dil me hota hai,        [A] [F#m]
Mujhe pyaar hai intezaar hai,        [A]
